very runner who gets tagged joins the hunt. How long can you last?Quick Play: jump straight into a match with other players. Bots fill any empty seats, so you're never stuck waiting.Levels 1–10: earn XP every round and unlock new paint colors, th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:16:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926301","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5109830-1842846814441673","game_id":"steam-5109830","kind":"announcement","title":"Our next playtest is going live this weekend!","summary":"Hello, fellow parkour painters! 🎨 Our first Brush Rush Playtest weekend was amazing! We even hosted a last minute playtest sunday to run it again due to the demand. We've now given 213 steamers/press/players access to the game, and we are so thankful for all the feedback/moments/clips we've recieved in return. We look forward to the next round of playtests which we’ll be hosting this Saturday, September 5th, from 9:00PM CST to 10:00PM CST. This weekends playtest will have 2 new maps in the rotat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T22:39:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441673","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5109830-1842212951308109","game_id":"steam-5109830","kind":"announcement","title":"Our first playtest was so successful that we are doing another one tonight! 🔥","summary":"Hello, fellow parkour painters! 🎨 Our first Brush Rush Playtest was a huge success! We gave 145 players access to the game, and the response was incredible. Unfortunately, we couldn’t get everyone in this time, so we’ll be hosting another small playtest tonight from 7:30PM CST to 8:30PM CST, followed by much larger playtests in the coming weeks. The support, excitement, and especially the feedback have been amazing. We’re already going through your suggestions and using them to improve the game,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T17:38:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:26:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5109830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5109830":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5109830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z"},"5314890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:22:45Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5109830","app_id":5109830,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:32Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5a19ea094c8bc7c99e25780d9dc393153c35a2c0b74f17609bd2f1179c50ad6c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"직접 파쿠르 길을 페인트로 만들며 탈출하세요! Meccha Tag는 캐주얼 멀티플레이 술래잡기 게임입니다. 러너는 3D 길을 만들고, 헌터는 초인적인 이동 능력과 페인트 샷건, 복싱 글러브로 추격합니다. 공개 매치와 스트리밍도 환영합니다!","publishers":[{"name":"Moonlighter Games","creator_clan_account_id":46091059}],"developers":[{"name":"Zac Marvin"},{"name":"Edward DePew"},{"name":"Bronson Bragg"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793226480,"is_coming_soon":true